            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.24.12+2KI.24.13+2KI.24.14+2KI.24.15+2KI.24.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ilai 24.12-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 36.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kulo ninche irorei leina palai nairriwayie ilo oiboni le Nkai oji Yeremia etii Yerusalem airriwaki lelo payiani apa le yararoto, o lapolosak, o loibonok, o ltung'ana pooki apa, ootarayie Nebukadnesa aitung'uaa Yerusalem nepuo Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina kata apa eidipa olaiguanani Yekonia, o ng'otonye enkitok olaiguanani, o lelo sunaishi oogelema, o lkituaak le Yuda o Yerusalem, o lelo arriyiak tenguetare o lkunono, aatudumunye aatung'uai Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eirriwayioki apa ina palai te nkaina e Elesa olayioni le Shafan o Gemaria olayioni le Hilkia, laa ninche eirriwayie Sedekia olaiguanani le Yuda Babilon enetii Nebukadnesa olaiguanani le Babilon. Nejo apa ina palai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nji ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani, Enkai e Israel, te lelo pooki le yararoto apa natarayie nanu meshomo eyararoto aaing'uaa Yerusalem nepuo Babilon: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enteshet nkajijik nitonini tiatua ninche; entuun nkurman ninyanya enkisampuare enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyamisho niiuu ilayiok o ntoyie; eyamaki ilayiok linyi, ninchosho ntoyie inyi meyami, pee etum aatoiu ilayiok o ntoyie; entoponari teine, nimiakuku kuti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake engoru olmabarishoi leina anasa apa naterewa intae te yararoto, niomonono Olaitoriani te rishata enye, tialo ninye amu ore tiatua olmabarishoi lenye nitumutumu intae olmabarishoi linyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu nji ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani, Enkai e Israel: Emincho iloibonok linyi o laitumusumusok linyi otii atua intae elej intae, nimining'ining'i nena kidetidetat naidetidetu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amu ore ina naa elejare naibonoki ninche intae te nkarna ai, eitu nanu airriu ninche, Olaitoriani ojo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
